{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-p022a","title":"魏书哀策记曹叡亲遣郭后梓宫","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-p022a-account","label":"《魏书》哀策","text":"魏书哀策记曹叡亲遣郭后梓宫","evidence":["houfei-e-p022a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"遣奠","evidence":["houfei-e-p022a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"青龙〔三〕年〔二〕月壬申","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o025","basis":"青龙〔三〕年〔二〕月壬申"},"evidence":["houfei-e-p022a-q","houfei-q-o025","houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-p022a-q","source_order":[5,212,"P022a"],"related_events":[{"event":"mingdi-e-o043f","type":"related","evidence":["houfei-e-p022a-q","mingdi-e-o043f-q"]}],"order":1449},{"id":"mingdi-e-o043f","title":"葬文德郭后","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o043f-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"葬文德郭后","evidence":["mingdi-e-o043f-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o042a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"青龙三年三月庚寅：青龙三年三月庚寅，葬郭后于首阳陵西。","evidence":["houfei-e-o042a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"三月庚寅","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o043","basis":"三月庚寅"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o043f-q","mingdi-q-o043","mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o043f-q","source_order":[3,293,"O043f"],"related_events":[{"event":"houfei-e-p022a","type":"related","evidence":["houfei-e-p022a-q","mingdi-e-o043f-q"]}],"order":876}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-p022a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-622d1900caefa92bba5f","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》载哀策曰：“维青龙（二）〔三〕年（三）〔二〕月壬申，皇太后梓宫启殡，将葬于首阳之西陵。哀子皇帝叡，亲奉册祖载，遂亲遣奠，叩心擗踊，号啕仰诉。痛灵魂之迁幸，悲容车之向路。背三光以潜翳，就黄垆而安厝。呜呼哀哉！昔二女妃虞，帝道以彰。三母嫔周，圣善弥光。既多受祉，享国延长。哀哀慈妣，兴化闺房。龙飞紫极，作合圣皇。不虞中年，暴罹灾殃。愍予小子，茕茕摧伤。魂虽永逝，定省曷望？呜呼哀哉！’”","attribution":"《魏书》哀策","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-48fb337a59ce749f4b97","start":0,"end":195},{"id":"houfei-q-b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-e47ffea5cca5eab53d92","layer":"modern","quote":"〖15〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4aa0b3373c71cedadeb9","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"houfei-q-o025","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0744a279ae4c62a54e64","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年春，追谥后兄俨曰安城乡穆侯。夏，吴贼寇扬州，以像为伏波将军〖12〗，持节，监诸将东征〖13〗。还，复为射声校尉〖14〗。三年薨〖15〗，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县，谥曰贞侯。子畅嗣。又封畅弟温、4 、艳，皆为列侯。四年〖16〗，改逸、俨本封，皆曰魏昌侯，谥因故〖17〗。封俨世妇刘为东乡君〖18〗，又追封逸世妇张为安喜君。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":97,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":163},{"id":"mingdi-e-o043f-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-9b32a12fd737552ea52d","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，戊子〖1〗，以大将军司马宣王为太尉。己亥〖2〗。复置朔方郡。京都大疫。丁巳〖3〗，皇太后崩。乙亥〖4〗，陨石于寿光县〖5〗。三月，庚寅〖6〗，葬文德郭后。营陵于首阳陵涧西〖7〗，如终制。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
